  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your oven to 250°C. Prepare a 20 inch diameter wok or clay pot with a lid.",
    "Mix the salt, rice flour and spices in a bowl.",
    "Rub the spice and salt mixture all over the pork shoulder.",
    "Place the pork in the wok or clay pot and drizzle with olive oil.",
    "Add the chopped onion on top of the pork.",
    "Tie the rosemary sprigs around the top of the wok or clay pot.",
    "Cover the wok and bake for 5 hours.",
    "Remove the wok from the oven and carefully open the lid.",
    "Drizzle with lemon juice and let rest for 10 minutes before slicing and serving."
